  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Shadowmaw alternate species ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Up to your Charisma modifier times per day when you save against a spell with your shadowmaw ability you may forgo your temporary hit point gain to renew your mental and martial skills. You may regain a maneuver, regain your psionic focus, or gain martial focus. The effect you resisted must be a level higher than any maneuver you wish to regain.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/shadow-fey#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
